    (EmptyView), exactly like the web HOC returning null. view.opened telemetry is
    DEFERRED until the gate opens (web data-ai-feature marker parity).
  - Stream (web useAiStream({url:'/ai/digests/weekly/narrate', body:{vehicle_id,
    week_offset_weeks:0}})): bound through the AIDigestNarrationStreamer seam. generate()
    mirrors stream.start(); the request coalesces a missing vehicle to 0 (web vehicleId ?? 0).
    No HTTP in the view.
  - Composition (web AIFeatureCard + AiOutputPanel):
      • header  -> title "Helix narration" + AIBadge "Helix" (Sparkles chip) + description.
      • action  -> universal CTA: visible "Ask Helix" idle / "Helix is thinking…" streaming;
                   VoiceOver name "Ask Helix · Generate narration" (web aria-label); disabled
                   = !canStart || streaming (+ P4 offline guard).
      • output  -> friendly idle empty | thinking (skeleton + dots) | streamed prose
                   (whitespace-preserved, selectable) | "Helix error: <msg>" + Try again.
  - States (ALL rendered, each with a #if DEBUG preview + a model/projection unit test):
      gated (withdrawn) · loading (gate skeleton) · idle/empty · no-vehicle (emptyHint +
      disabled) · thinking · done (prose) · error (+retry) · stale (chip + one-shot auto-
      refresh) · offline (cached prose kept + chip + banner + action withheld).
